Package: misoR
Title: Mixture of Sparse Poisson Factor Models
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Dat", "Do", email = "dodat.stats@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fit mixtures of sparse Poisson factor models using variational
    empirical Bayes. Combines Poisson sum-of-single-effects initialization,
    blocked variational updates, and dictionary learning. Supports dense and
    sparse count matrices, reusable initializations, posterior summaries,
    and visualizations of observation-level factor loadings.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Matrix, methods, stats, graphics, grDevices, utils
Suggests: roxygen2
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
